  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>g</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"> <mrow> <mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mn>0</mn> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math><br />So, <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is not differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>"
